ulate ${\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s,$ where $C$ is the line segment shown above." :question/worked-solution "The line integral of unity with respect to arc length over $C$ is equal to the arc length $L$ of $C,$ i.e.,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=L.\n$$\n\nIn this case, the path $C$ is the hypotenuse of a right triangle whose legs have lengths $\\frac{5}{2}$ and $\\frac{9}{2}.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & =\\sqrt{{\\frac{5}{2}}^{2}+{\\frac{9}{2}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{25}{4}+\\frac{81}{4}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{53}{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{106}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=\\frac{\\sqrt{106}}{2}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186543790 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b4ac9e7d-ea92-5cd3-af26-4c902196e80b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Line Integrals of Unity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "1642d82e-aaf4-5dc7-b840-fd605481d7d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{9553}}{12}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543732} {:answer/id #uuid "3be4d6b3-5d17-572c-90b2-27db2fe2d8e7" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{23}{3}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543742} {:answer/id #uuid "68da3236-b33a-54f3-9680-824859e6c87e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{125}{12}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543756} {:answer/id #uuid "7485f311-4668-53e6-8a59-a539e0d485f4" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{11}{4}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543759} {:answer/id #uuid "afbe321e-939b-56c9-817f-01610d34b2c3" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{9553}{144}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543775}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "1642d82e-aaf4-5dc7-b840-fd605481d7d6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{9553}}{12}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543732} :answer-field/id #uuid "1a358841-d73c-50e0-9845-45c9af1c42f2