.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186543799 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b4ac9e7d-ea92-5cd3-af26-4c902196e80b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Line Integrals of Unity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "141b04a5-95ff-5e8f-89d4-89018ec5ed3f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{17}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543731} {:answer/id #uuid "1a05f5c0-053d-563c-9455-6fed01a6acf6" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543733} {:answer/id #uuid "7295c22b-d98c-5d62-aa75-65aed2ee7b8f" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{157}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543758} {:answer/id #uuid "df5212a1-a699-55d0-a0bc-daf012979f8e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{314}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543796} {:answer/id #uuid "ff23cbd1-0a67-54ae-8a50-d6a0d23aecfc" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{5}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543804}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "df5212a1-a699-55d0-a0bc-daf012979f8e" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\frac{\\sqrt{314}}{2}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543796} :answer-field/id #uuid "6612a747-3cd8-5a2c-a3d2-e364a3b8f6ae" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543755}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045487 :db/ident :question.difficulty/moderate} :question/id #uuid "e3d1be88-150b-5f14-913f-6b68318755da" :question/problem "![](images/18/184a128aa9cd2c21049f72eff286c08d128a5fee3d9a716d984369c6fee21278.png)\n\nCalculate ${\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s,$ where $C$ is the line segment shown above." :question/worked-solution "The line integral of unity with respect to arc length over $C$ is equal to the arc length $L$ of $C,$ i.e.,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=L.\n$$\n\nIn this case, the path $C$ is the hypotenuse of a right triangle whose legs have lengths $\\frac{17}{2}$ and $\\frac{5}{2}:$ \n\n![](images/ac/ac98d9896020e1cc8708b62d6ceeac3e7edcd2ce39ee6ef60dbbe89100b2b8d2.png)\n\nTherefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & =\\sqrt{{\\frac{17}{2}}^{2}+{\\frac{5}{2}}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{289}{4}+\\frac{25}{4}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{\\frac{157}{2}} \\\\  & =\\frac{\\sqrt{314}}{2}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=\\frac{\\sqrt{314}}{2}.\n$$"} {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186543801 :knowledge-point/_questions [{:knowledge-point/id #uuid "b4ac9e7d-ea92-5cd3-af26-4c902196e80b" :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Line Integrals of Unity"}] :question/answer-fields [{:answer-field/choices [{:answer/id #uuid "078dc799-523b-5bbc-a06e-b73097fc8574" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "85" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543728} {:answer/id #uuid "26cc1f82-efdb-5093-ac2f-9c31baa4a784" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "11" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543736} {:answer/id #uuid "3c35cfa5-9c6f-5783-b74d-6844f1b6a364" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "2" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543743} {:answer/id #uuid "53e796c8-568a-551b-87c9-aa92b93a33a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{85}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543753} {:answer/id #uuid "f9090f52-8e55-5562-b825-81ea0a5d6ecb" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "9" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543803}] :answer-field/correct {:answer/id #uuid "53e796c8-568a-551b-87c9-aa92b93a33a0" :answer/type {:db/ident :answer.type/math} :answer/value "\\sqrt{85}" :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543753} :answer-field/id #uuid "6f82a27e-a9f6-5e22-abd0-8d89910cf32d" :answer-field/key "selection" :answer-field/type {:db/ident :answer-field.type/radio} :db/id #edb/ref 17592186543757}] :question/difficulty {:db/id #edb/ref 17592186045485 :db/ident :question.difficulty/easy} :question/id #uuid "ea05930e-fc4b-5ce3-8181-3ec67304640f" :question/problem "![](images/38/388a18afaef104f8036ae6ca36786fada32fa614c724c5f5bd8f3c225a9b7286.png)\n\nCalculate ${\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s,$ where $C$ is the line segment shown above." :question/worked-solution "The line integral of unity with respect to arc length over $C$ is equal to the arc length $L$ of $C,$ i.e.,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=L.\n$$\n\nIn this case, the path $C$ is the hypotenuse of a right triangle whose legs have lengths $2$ and $9.$ Therefore, we have\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}L & =\\sqrt{{2}^{2}+{9}^{2}} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{4+81} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{85} \\\\  & =\\sqrt{85}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nTherefore,\n\n$$\n{\\int }_{C}\\,\\text{d}s=\\sqrt{85}.\n$$"}] :knowledge-point/title "Calculating Line Integrals of Unity"}]}
